    "title": "Senior Fleet Manager at Geodis India Ventures Solutions",
    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at Geodis India Ventures Solutions. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Fleet Manager to strengthen our Vadodara-based team.\n\nAbout Geodis India Ventures Solutions:\nGeodis India Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Handle customs clearance for import and export shipments\n• Conduct periodic vendor audits and evaluate logistics partners\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n• Implement cost-saving initiatives in transportation and warehousing\n• Coordinate with customer service teams to resolve delivery issues\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Freight Forwarding\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in Last Mile Delivery\n• Proficiency in TMS\n• Proficiency in Cold Chain Logistics\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vadodara, Gujarat, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Geodis India Ventures Solutions!",
